    "description": "<h2><b>Welcome to Valentia: Experience an RPG Card Battle with Roguelike Deck Building and choose heroes to save this land!</b></h2>\r\n\r\nValentia, a vibrant and captivating world, is under attack by Chaos and all the heroes have been defeated! \r\n\r\nNow it's up to the misfits and aspiring heroes to confront dangerous challenges and keep this land safe and free from Chaos.\r\n\r\nI, Imp, your mysterious and charming host, am here to recruit heroes! Will you answer my call? \r\n\r\nI'll bestow you with immeasurable powers to help save us from Chaos, that strange energy which changes everything in a... well, chaotic way! Perhaps you could lend a hand to me \u2014 I mean, to the lands of Valentia!\r\n\r\nIn Card Guardians, every card battle offers an opportunity to showcase your deck strategy and skills in a game that blends RPG, deckbuilding, and roguelike elements.\r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019re coming from a casual world or the depths of dungeons, different from other roguelike card games, Card Guardians is simple to pick up but hard to set aside! \r\n\r\nReady for the excitement of card battle games?\r\n\r\n<h3><b>\ud83d\udd2e Master Strategic Card Battles</b></h3>\r\nHey there, brave soul! In the world of Card Guardians, every adventure brings unpredictable and varied card challenges. \r\n\r\nEach RPG journey through Valentia offers new obstacles and delightful ways to showcase your deck strategy. Why not get creative and discover the perfect deck building combination to snatch victory?\r\n\r\nAs you travel, you'll unlock powerful RPG cards. Choose your RPG deck wisely, build your card deck, and craft strategic combinations to outwit those challenging enemies.\r\n\r\nEvery time you win, you'll be showered with valuable loot to enhance your attributes and abilities. Equipment, magical runes, and more will make you even stronger for future roguelike challenges. \r\n\r\nRemember, choosing your RPG deck building wisely is your best bet against the forces of chaos. Now, go on and show them what you're made of!\r\n\r\n<h3><b>\u2694\ufe0f Become Valentia\u2019s Hero</b></h3>\r\nAh, brave adventurer, let me tell you about this chaotic world! In a land consumed by chaos, where the guardians meant to protect have been corrupted, only a few heroes remain who can battle this corruption and restore their true forms. \r\n\r\nThey must use every roguelike card games tool at their disposal and prepare for the RPG challenges that lie ahead.\r\n\r\nYou can choose from unique RPG heroes, each with their own distinct powers and playstyles for your deck building. Louis, the eager swordsman, and Oriana, the cosmic witch, offer different approaches to combat. \r\n\r\nWhich hero will lead you to victory?\r\n\r\nWith a unique card deck, you\u2019ll face strange creatures and uncover runes of immense power. Discover new cards, equipment, and roguelike strategies to overcome the toughest challenges.\r\n\r\nCreate and battle with your own deck, mastering your magic along the way.\r\n\r\n<h3><b>\ud83c\udf0e Explore a Fantasy Card Games World</b></h3>\r\nCard Guardians stays true to its casual roots while also appealing to midcore players with its strategic depth. \r\n\r\nNo matter your play style, you'll find fun and challenge here. Win epic battles by mastering your RPG deck building. \r\n\r\nAre you ready to dive into this adventure and show your strategic prowess?\r\n\r\nUnveil the secrets of Valentia by exploring dungeons, castles, forests, and deserts. Improve your RPG cards collection and earn rewards while facing challenges only a true tactician can conquer. \r\n\r\nWhat treasures and secrets will you uncover on your journey?\r\n\r\nCard Guardians is a free roguelike card game by Tapps Games, with optional in-app purchases that offer additional features and items to enhance your experience. \r\n\r\nWhy not join us and see what all the excitement is about?\r\n\r\nDownload now and embark on this card deck builder adventure. Your journey in Valentia awaits!\r\n\r\n<b>Contact us</b>\r\nReddit: https://www.reddit.com/r/card_guardians/?rdt=38291\r\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/yT58FtdRt9",
